# ── data files we never commit ───────────────────────────────────────────
# O*NET/IPIP source downloads are redistributable only under their licence
# terms; each developer downloads them directly (plan R2, §6). The derived,
# hand-transcribed CSVs in data/instruments/ ARE committed — that transcription
# is the auditable artifact R2 cares about, not the original PDF/HTML.
#
# The `**` matters: the O*NET archive extracts into a versioned subdirectory
# (db_31_0_csv/), so a rule anchored at data/onet/ alone misses all 46 files.
data/onet/**/*.csv
data/onet/**/*.txt
data/onet/**/*.pdf
data/onet/**/*.html
data/onet/**/*.zip

# ── local tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
